WEBVTT

00:09.884 --> 00:11.052
You're too loud.

00:15.265 --> 00:16.141
What?

00:18.852 --> 00:20.311
Don't cross the line.

00:25.400 --> 00:26.234
He's crazy.

00:30.989 --> 00:31.948
Today's the day.

00:33.074 --> 00:34.117
Hey, today's the day!

00:34.909 --> 00:36.536
Yeon Si-eun, you asshole.

00:36.619 --> 00:38.455
I've been fucking easy on you.

00:38.538 --> 00:40.665
Did you know that? You had no idea, right?

01:04.689 --> 01:06.024
That must have hurt!

01:28.588 --> 01:31.508
Hey, you can take a punch. You really can.

01:33.134 --> 01:34.010
Fuck you!

01:56.199 --> 02:01.371
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

02:56.342 --> 02:58.595
MAKE IT TO THE TOP, BAKSAL

02:58.678 --> 03:00.013
Tell me about it.

03:00.680 --> 03:03.516
He's only suspended.
Why can't he be in the tournament?

03:03.600 --> 03:05.393
It's not like he was expelled.

03:06.102 --> 03:09.439
Baku's the captain.
Captains shouldn't get into fights.

03:09.522 --> 03:10.356
Hey.

03:11.357 --> 03:13.860
Didn't I tell you
that he didn't get into fights?

03:14.360 --> 03:15.195
That's right.

03:16.613 --> 03:17.906
I doubt it was a fight.

03:18.656 --> 03:20.742
Probably more like a massacre.

03:20.825 --> 03:22.493
Yeah, I bet he beat their asses.

03:23.161 --> 03:24.329
Probably hurt like hell.

03:24.829 --> 03:26.206
Are they still alive?

03:26.915 --> 03:28.708
Are you fucking serious?

03:29.626 --> 03:31.085
- Seriously?
- Come on. Damn.

03:31.169 --> 03:32.462
- Hey.
- Such a short fuse.

03:32.545 --> 03:33.838
I can't take this.

03:33.922 --> 03:35.256
I'll speak to the teacher.

03:35.340 --> 03:37.217
We have to play in that tournament.

03:37.300 --> 03:38.843
Hey, don't do it!

03:39.427 --> 03:40.345
Hey, Hyun-tak!

03:42.722 --> 03:43.556
Let go of me!

03:43.640 --> 03:45.558
Hey! Choi Hyo-man has fucking lost it!

03:45.642 --> 03:46.893
They're fighting now!

03:46.976 --> 03:48.228
Hey, come on. Hurry!

03:48.311 --> 03:49.896
This is gonna be fucking fun!

03:49.979 --> 03:51.481
What the fuck is going on?

03:52.774 --> 03:53.691
Choi Hyo-man?

03:54.359 --> 03:55.610
That son of a bitch.

03:56.319 --> 03:58.696
He must be bullying someone
since Baku's not here.

03:59.822 --> 04:01.532
I thought it was a bit quiet.

04:04.827 --> 04:07.121
This is driving me nuts. Shit.

04:07.205 --> 04:08.581
Fight! There's a fight!

04:09.332 --> 04:10.166
I can't see!

04:10.250 --> 04:12.252
I can't see anything. Move.

04:13.044 --> 04:13.878
Hey, move it.

04:13.962 --> 04:16.172
- Why?
- Out of the way. Move.

04:35.108 --> 04:37.652
Hey, you can take a punch. You really can.

04:39.779 --> 04:42.115
Wait for his shoulder to open up.

04:49.872 --> 04:51.165
Fuck!

04:54.919 --> 04:55.753
Fuck!

04:57.255 --> 04:58.089
Fuck!

05:01.843 --> 05:04.345
Hey. Are you kidding me?

05:05.263 --> 05:06.889
Fucking asshole.

05:07.390 --> 05:08.224
Hey.

05:09.934 --> 05:12.603
What the fuck are you looking at, asshole?

05:12.687 --> 05:14.605
What the hell are you trying to do?

05:16.024 --> 05:16.858
Hey.

05:19.402 --> 05:21.195
- What are you doing, fucker?
- Hey!

05:29.329 --> 05:30.955
Hyo-man, you fucking moron.

05:31.748 --> 05:33.041
Is this fun for you?

05:33.124 --> 05:36.627
Yeah, really fucking fun.
So just beat it. I'm busy right now.

05:36.711 --> 05:39.714
Busy, my fucking ass. You don't look busy.

05:40.715 --> 05:43.343
Do I have to beat it when you say so?

05:43.885 --> 05:46.721
You look worn out.
Take a breath before you speak, loser.

05:46.804 --> 05:47.722
"Loser"?

05:47.805 --> 05:50.850
You're the loser. Baku's lackey.

05:50.933 --> 05:53.102
Are you cosplaying as Baku or what?

05:55.313 --> 05:56.439
What the fuck?

05:59.192 --> 06:00.443
What did you just say?

06:03.780 --> 06:04.697
Say it again.

06:06.824 --> 06:07.700
Fuck.

06:10.078 --> 06:12.330
You're Baku's lackey. Happy now, asshole?

06:12.413 --> 06:14.415
If Baku didn't have your back--

06:24.175 --> 06:25.009
Hyo-man.

06:25.968 --> 06:28.346
I can take you down in one second, fucker.

06:28.888 --> 06:29.847
So now what?

06:30.890 --> 06:32.183
Should we go to the gym?

06:36.854 --> 06:38.147
The fucking gym?

06:38.898 --> 06:40.733
The floor's slippery there.

06:40.817 --> 06:42.819
I'll take you down soon, fucking idiot.

06:43.319 --> 06:44.821
You too, motherfucker!

06:45.905 --> 06:46.989
Move, damn it.

06:49.117 --> 06:50.410
He said move it, damn.

06:50.493 --> 06:51.327
Don't laugh.

06:51.911 --> 06:54.831
- Gotak's second toughest after Baku!
- Shut your mouth.

06:56.290 --> 06:58.418
That was cool, Gotak! Nice job!

06:58.501 --> 06:59.377
Hey, look.

06:59.460 --> 07:02.171
Don't thank me. That'd be cringe.
But next time, you…

07:18.938 --> 07:20.857
Let's go to the nurse's office.

07:36.372 --> 07:37.206
Hey.

07:38.708 --> 07:40.001
Well,

07:40.543 --> 07:43.171
it wasn't like I had to hear a thank-you.

07:44.005 --> 07:45.131
But this?

07:46.466 --> 07:48.718
Are you ungrateful or just a jerk?

07:50.094 --> 07:50.928
Yeah.

07:51.637 --> 07:52.472
Thanks.

08:01.898 --> 08:03.232
What's with that punk?

08:18.748 --> 08:19.665
What are you doing?

08:21.083 --> 08:22.543
We're going to see the nurse.

08:24.837 --> 08:26.839
We can't go to the nurse's office.

08:42.855 --> 08:43.981
Whenever we…

08:46.150 --> 08:47.610
go there,

08:49.362 --> 08:51.364
the nurse realizes what's happened,

08:52.490 --> 08:55.368
so Hyo-man gets called
to the teachers' office all the time.

08:56.744 --> 08:59.288
And we just get beaten up again.

09:00.831 --> 09:02.166
It's an endless cycle.

09:06.045 --> 09:10.716
Fucidin cream is
pretty much an antibiotic.

09:10.800 --> 09:13.678
If you think you could get an infection,

09:14.220 --> 09:17.181
you have to use… Fucidin.

09:19.183 --> 09:20.059
Because

09:21.227 --> 09:25.398
Hyo-man's fists are like balls of germs.

09:27.817 --> 09:28.943
Why did you do it?

09:32.405 --> 09:33.239
What?

09:35.157 --> 09:37.034
Why did you return all the phones?

09:42.081 --> 09:43.583
Newton's third law.

09:44.959 --> 09:47.962
"For every good action,
a good reaction follows."

09:52.717 --> 09:54.010
That's not what it means.

09:58.431 --> 09:59.640
Jun-tae, are you okay?

09:59.724 --> 10:01.434
Jun-tae-kun, are you all right?

10:01.934 --> 10:02.977
Jun-tae-kun.

10:03.477 --> 10:06.564
It was a close call for me today.

10:07.898 --> 10:10.526
My vision went dark, then back to normal.

10:11.652 --> 10:12.778
However,

10:12.862 --> 10:16.365
I think the pancake mouth guard saved me.

10:18.159 --> 10:19.035
I see.

10:19.577 --> 10:24.624
One day, Hyo-man, I shall claim your life
with my Nichirin Sword.

10:24.707 --> 10:26.042
It's not the time yet.

10:26.125 --> 10:26.959
He's right.

10:28.210 --> 10:29.170
Is it?

10:35.801 --> 10:37.178
Fuck, man.

10:37.261 --> 10:39.138
- NO FIGHTING
- BAKU-

10:39.221 --> 10:41.474
It was a blast to finally see
a fight at Eunjang.

10:41.557 --> 10:42.475
A fucking blast!

10:42.558 --> 10:43.517
- Right.
- Seriously.

10:43.601 --> 10:44.727
You know what?

10:44.810 --> 10:47.438
- You can't really call that a fight.
- Why not?

10:47.521 --> 10:50.858
Si-eun didn't even throw a punch.
You call that a fight?

10:50.941 --> 10:53.152
But he could really take a beating!

10:53.235 --> 10:54.153
Yeah!

10:54.236 --> 10:55.780
And that Si-eun asshole,

10:55.863 --> 10:57.615
his eyes are weird.

10:58.115 --> 11:00.368
- He looks like a fucking lunatic!
- Totally!

11:00.951 --> 11:04.205
After seeing that,
I reckon the rumors about him are true.

11:05.039 --> 11:07.625
Now I know why Hyo-man was avoiding him.

11:07.708 --> 11:09.585
- Seriously, man.
- Man, I love that dude.

11:09.669 --> 11:11.045
Love him? I can fight too.

11:11.128 --> 11:11.962
Bullshit.

11:12.046 --> 11:13.547
I'm a fucking good fighter.

11:13.631 --> 11:16.384
No, seriously, I can dodge every hit.

11:16.467 --> 11:17.343
Hey, guys.

11:18.844 --> 11:19.887
What are you on about?

11:20.471 --> 11:21.931
Why did Hyo-man avoid Si-eun?

11:22.682 --> 11:23.891
Well,

11:23.974 --> 11:26.227
have you been living under a rock?

11:26.310 --> 11:27.645
Hey, tell me about it.

11:29.605 --> 11:35.152
Remember how Si-eun had beef with Hyo-man
right after he transferred here last year?

11:35.236 --> 11:36.237
Yeah.

11:36.320 --> 11:40.449
So Hyo-man called
all around Si-eun's old neighborhood.

11:40.950 --> 11:43.369
You know, to find out about him.

11:44.620 --> 11:45.538
And?

11:45.621 --> 11:46.789
And fuck, man!

11:46.872 --> 11:49.208
He seriously injured some kids!

11:49.291 --> 11:52.712
He hit them on the head with a dumbbell
and stabbed them in the neck!

11:54.839 --> 11:56.590
It's a fucking legend there.

11:56.674 --> 11:59.593
Explains why Hyo-man's all talk
but won't lay a finger on Si-eun,

11:59.677 --> 12:01.637
even though that makes
him look like a wimp.

12:01.721 --> 12:03.222
- That's right.
- Fuck!

12:07.184 --> 12:08.477
That's ridiculous.

12:09.186 --> 12:10.563
What a bunch of bullshit.

12:10.646 --> 12:11.689
It's true!

12:11.772 --> 12:13.774
Si-eun's grades are fucking good.

12:13.858 --> 12:15.151
So why's he at Eunjang?

12:15.234 --> 12:19.238
After that nasty-ass incident,
no other schools would take him.

12:22.408 --> 12:24.285
Let's go to the nurse's office.

12:26.412 --> 12:27.246
Hey.

12:32.668 --> 12:33.502
Yeah.

12:34.003 --> 12:34.837
Thanks.

12:37.506 --> 12:38.507
Hey, guys.

12:38.591 --> 12:41.635
Let's not talk shit about him
when we don't know the facts.

12:42.636 --> 12:43.471
Okay?

12:44.972 --> 12:46.515
You guys reek of smoke.

12:47.308 --> 12:48.684
Man, I'm cool.

12:48.768 --> 12:51.187
- Fucking ridiculous.
- Is he triggered or something?

12:51.270 --> 12:52.271
Cut it out.

13:02.865 --> 13:03.908
What's your deal?

13:05.576 --> 13:06.577
What?

13:06.660 --> 13:07.953
I said, what's your deal?

13:10.372 --> 13:12.041
Just get going.

13:20.007 --> 13:22.635
Hyo-man must be fucking humiliated.

13:22.718 --> 13:24.887
Wait, maybe I could beat him up.

13:24.970 --> 13:25.971
Bullshit, you punk.

13:26.055 --> 13:27.681
- I might seriously win!
- No way.

13:27.765 --> 13:28.599
Hey.

13:36.982 --> 13:38.984
What did that asshole Gotak say?

13:41.403 --> 13:43.364
Oh, not too much.

13:45.199 --> 13:46.951
He just said that Si-eun

13:48.202 --> 13:50.621
didn't seem to be a psychopath
like all the rumors said.

13:51.997 --> 13:54.542
He told us not to talk shit
behind his back.

13:55.626 --> 13:58.587
- Gotak took his fucking side.
- Yeah.

13:58.671 --> 14:00.548
That fucker, acting all nice.

14:08.013 --> 14:12.977
Ungrated? Ungreat? Ungrate?
What was that fucking word again?

14:13.060 --> 14:14.520
Hey.

14:14.603 --> 14:17.481
- Yeah?
- Do you know what this feels like?

14:18.107 --> 14:19.191
- What?
- What?

14:20.568 --> 14:23.404
When you cover for someone,
and they stab you in the back.

14:26.448 --> 14:28.242
That's real fucking annoying.

14:29.159 --> 14:30.160
Right?

14:34.290 --> 14:35.207
Si-eun!

14:40.838 --> 14:41.672
Well…

14:42.840 --> 14:46.176
Here's some lutein and magnesium.

14:46.677 --> 14:49.138
Lutein is good for your eyes
when you study.

14:49.221 --> 14:52.391
Magnesium can help you sleep better.

14:55.019 --> 14:58.314
You seem to sleep a lot at school.

15:05.696 --> 15:06.989
Thanks for today.

15:09.950 --> 15:11.368
See you tomorrow at school.

15:16.749 --> 15:18.334
What's your first hot tip?

15:18.417 --> 15:21.462
Well, above all, sleep is very important.

15:21.545 --> 15:25.799
If you don't get enough sleep,
you'll have trouble thinking,

15:25.883 --> 15:29.053
even with things you normally know well.

15:29.136 --> 15:30.971
You need to get a good night's sleep.

15:31.055 --> 15:32.723
That's the most important thing.

15:32.806 --> 15:39.355
That's right. I remember trying
to force myself to sleep before the CSAT.

15:39.438 --> 15:43.233
But forcing it
just made it harder to sleep.

15:43.317 --> 15:45.069
Any tips for falling asleep?

15:45.152 --> 15:49.281
In my case,
it was before the mock test in June.

15:49.365 --> 15:51.492
- I really couldn't sleep.
- I see.

15:51.575 --> 15:54.411
I was so sleepy the next day
when I took the mock test.

15:54.954 --> 15:59.041
After that, any time I couldn't sleep,
I took a nice warm bath…

16:24.149 --> 16:25.693
Aren't you tired today?

16:26.568 --> 16:28.445
You're not sleeping through lunch.

16:32.449 --> 16:34.785
What you gave me seemed to work.

16:36.453 --> 16:37.329
What?

16:38.497 --> 16:39.415
The magnesium?

16:41.458 --> 16:42.292
Thanks.

16:44.628 --> 16:45.629
Don't mention it.

16:48.173 --> 16:50.592
Right, Si-eun. Do you take multivitamins?

16:51.260 --> 16:54.138
I have a great one. You should try it
when we go back to class.

16:54.221 --> 16:57.391
It's important to take vitamins every day.

16:57.474 --> 17:00.477
It's good to take them
30 minutes after a meal,

17:00.561 --> 17:03.022
then it won't strain your stomach.

17:03.105 --> 17:04.356
If you keep taking it--

17:04.440 --> 17:05.649
Your mouth is full.

17:07.568 --> 17:09.403
Why don't you swallow first?

17:11.113 --> 17:13.073
Right. Yes, sir.

17:20.080 --> 17:21.290
Ungrateful.

17:22.833 --> 17:24.209
Ungrateful.

17:32.509 --> 17:33.343
It's strange.

17:37.347 --> 17:41.935
I've never had such a peaceful lunch.

17:42.019 --> 17:43.520
I'm a little anxious.

17:51.570 --> 17:53.072
Hey, friends!

17:54.531 --> 17:55.657
You're here!

17:56.158 --> 17:57.951
I looked for you guys for ages.

17:58.577 --> 18:00.746
My goodness!

18:00.829 --> 18:01.705
Hello there.

18:04.083 --> 18:05.751
Si-eun, sorry about yesterday.

18:05.834 --> 18:09.088
I have some
serious anger management issues.

18:09.171 --> 18:10.839
Hey, I'm sorry. Seriously.

18:10.923 --> 18:13.258
Mr. Jun-tae. I'm really sorry, okay?

18:14.301 --> 18:15.135
Okay.

18:17.930 --> 18:19.848
Hey, get your hand off me.

18:22.559 --> 18:23.685
Okay, I get it.

18:23.769 --> 18:26.897
But really? I came to apologize,
and you're like that?

18:28.148 --> 18:30.275
Well, there is something else.

18:30.776 --> 18:32.611
See that punk in blue there?

18:33.612 --> 18:35.531
The one who butted in yesterday?

18:37.116 --> 18:38.283
That's Go Hyun-tak.

18:38.784 --> 18:41.995
He thinks he's something,
being part of the basketball club and all.

18:42.079 --> 18:45.374
But that's all for show.
He's actually a total scumbag.

18:46.625 --> 18:47.876
Having said that…

18:50.587 --> 18:51.421
be careful.

18:52.798 --> 18:54.967
That jerk is planning to beat you up.

19:01.014 --> 19:03.809
Hey. Nice job, Ju-seong!

19:07.479 --> 19:08.647
You're this tall, man.

19:08.730 --> 19:10.232
You could have blocked it!

19:10.315 --> 19:11.150
Hey, take it.

19:14.486 --> 19:15.362
What's that?

19:15.863 --> 19:17.489
Why is Hyo-man with Si-eun?

19:18.282 --> 19:19.241
Are they making up?

19:19.741 --> 19:20.701
No way.

19:24.121 --> 19:26.373
That son of a bitch keeps glaring.

19:27.374 --> 19:28.584
You stay out of it.

19:41.054 --> 19:43.348
Hey, just piss off. Don't come over here.

19:44.600 --> 19:47.728
You were the one glaring at me.

19:50.063 --> 19:52.065
Do you have something to say?

19:56.028 --> 19:57.779
What are you doing with Si-eun?

19:58.280 --> 20:00.365
I heard Si-eun was a big deal
at his last school,

20:00.449 --> 20:03.410
so I thought I'd try being his friend.

20:04.161 --> 20:05.120
Who knows?

20:05.621 --> 20:08.665
Maybe he'll be a huge help
with killing you and Baku.

20:09.249 --> 20:11.835
I should have done that
a long fucking time ago.

20:11.919 --> 20:13.212
What did you say, fucker?

20:13.295 --> 20:16.423
Oh no! It's school violence!

20:16.506 --> 20:17.507
Let go of me.

20:23.722 --> 20:27.142
Hey, Si-eun! I'll meet you
at the intersection later.

20:27.226 --> 20:28.060
I'll call you.

20:29.478 --> 20:31.897
Keep practicing your shots, guys.

20:51.833 --> 20:53.961
Si-eun, I'm going to the restroom.

21:01.635 --> 21:04.346
Jun-tae, come with us.

21:04.429 --> 21:05.472
It's a new mission.

21:05.555 --> 21:08.016
Yeah. Let's help Hyo-man a little. Okay?

21:11.019 --> 21:12.521
You need to practice!

21:13.146 --> 21:15.399
- You jerk.
- Height is all that matters!

21:15.482 --> 21:17.776
- You never pass, dude.
- Ju-seong, you really suck!

21:17.859 --> 21:18.819
Why didn't you pass?

21:18.902 --> 21:20.112
Are you going?

21:20.195 --> 21:21.571
You need practice.

21:22.322 --> 21:23.740
I'm better at dribbling.

21:24.241 --> 21:25.450
No way.

21:26.535 --> 21:27.661
Really?

21:40.007 --> 21:41.300
Please excuse me.

21:45.387 --> 21:46.972
Fuck. It really stinks.

21:49.141 --> 21:50.142
These punks.

22:00.110 --> 22:01.945
It's a fucking passing mistake!

22:20.130 --> 22:21.381
Fucking assholes.

22:25.218 --> 22:27.846
11TH GRADE, CLASS 4
SEO JUN-TAE

22:27.929 --> 22:32.434
Whether you're in school or not,
please don't do stupid things, okay?

22:33.018 --> 22:34.478
Don't drink alcohol.

22:35.437 --> 22:36.521
And don't smoke.

22:37.522 --> 22:39.066
Whose seat is that?

22:40.484 --> 22:41.318
Who sits there?

22:42.486 --> 22:43.528
Where's Seo Jun-tae?

22:48.075 --> 22:50.202
He's been gone since fifth period.

22:55.957 --> 22:58.960
What's gotten into you, Si-eun?
You speak now?

22:59.044 --> 22:59.961
No, I mean,

23:01.254 --> 23:02.839
what if something happened?

23:02.923 --> 23:04.216
What could happen?

23:05.092 --> 23:07.511
Have Jun-tae come to see me tomorrow.

23:07.594 --> 23:08.428
That's all.

23:13.183 --> 23:16.937
That took too fucking long!
I thought my ears were going to bleed.

23:18.730 --> 23:21.483
SEO JUN-TAE

23:25.904 --> 23:29.324
This device is switched off.
Please leave a message…

23:29.408 --> 23:30.367
Hey, Si-eun.

23:32.244 --> 23:34.413
Is Jun-tae okay?

23:34.913 --> 23:37.457
I saw Gotak dragging him
to their clubroom.

23:39.000 --> 23:43.046
The basketball clubroom.
It's the shed next to the annex.

23:44.131 --> 23:44.965
You should go.

23:55.517 --> 23:57.352
A master strategist at work.

24:02.232 --> 24:03.066
Right on.

24:05.318 --> 24:06.236
Right on.

24:58.246 --> 24:59.247
Si-eun.

25:02.167 --> 25:03.001
Are you okay?

25:08.131 --> 25:10.675
It was Choi Hyo-man, wasn't it?

25:23.855 --> 25:24.773
Excuse me.

25:26.441 --> 25:27.484
Go Hyun-tak…

25:29.736 --> 25:30.737
Go Hyun-tak?

25:35.700 --> 25:36.576
Who, me?

25:38.286 --> 25:42.332
Well… Yeon Si-eun wants to see you.

25:45.085 --> 25:45.961
Why's that?

25:48.880 --> 25:49.798
To fight you.

25:50.298 --> 25:52.842
Well, Choi Hyo-man

25:53.552 --> 25:55.220
teamed up with Si-eun

25:56.054 --> 25:58.223
to kill you and Baku.

26:01.643 --> 26:03.770
He's in the basketball clubroom.

26:04.479 --> 26:07.691
He's waiting there.
He wants you to come quickly.

26:08.858 --> 26:11.278
He said Baku's lackey would be easy.

26:20.370 --> 26:21.329
Damn it.

26:23.331 --> 26:24.165
Hey, Si-eun!

26:32.132 --> 26:33.008
Hey!

26:36.678 --> 26:38.763
What the fuck is wrong with him?

27:12.047 --> 27:12.881
Now focus.

27:13.381 --> 27:15.050
I'll tell you one last time.

27:15.133 --> 27:18.887
Once they get worn down from the fight,
we swoop in. Got it?

27:18.970 --> 27:21.097
- Gotak is our priority.
- Okay.

27:21.181 --> 27:23.558
If we have time, kick Si-eun's ass too.

27:23.642 --> 27:26.561
Now, repeat after me.
First Gotak, then Si-eun.

27:26.645 --> 27:28.313
First Gotak, then Si-eun!

27:28.396 --> 27:29.773
Yes, that's it. Good.

27:35.070 --> 27:37.197
Si-eun, do you usually take this route?

27:41.076 --> 27:42.285
Yes, why?

27:43.328 --> 27:46.414
Well, this is the shortcut,

27:47.040 --> 27:49.918
but you should go around it if possible

27:50.585 --> 27:55.298
because thugs take money from other kids
and get into fights around here.

27:56.925 --> 27:58.927
This is where I first met Hyo-man.

28:00.845 --> 28:04.432
Thanks to Baku, things are quieter now,

28:04.933 --> 28:06.434
but you never know.

28:09.479 --> 28:11.314
The other way is a waste of time.

28:12.941 --> 28:14.734
Well, that's true.

28:14.818 --> 28:20.615
- EUNJANG HIGH, NO FIGHTING
- BAKU-

28:24.077 --> 28:25.036
Hey!

28:28.915 --> 28:29.958
Go Hyun-tak?

28:31.918 --> 28:33.044
Fuck.

28:43.680 --> 28:44.556
What the hell?

28:46.725 --> 28:50.437
Who do you think you are,
messing up our clubroom, motherfucker?

28:50.937 --> 28:51.896
Well,

28:53.481 --> 28:55.150
there's been a misunderstanding--

28:55.233 --> 28:56.985
Stay the fuck out of this,

28:58.570 --> 29:00.071
or I swear I'll kill you.

29:07.746 --> 29:08.580
Beat me up.

29:10.790 --> 29:11.666
What?

29:12.250 --> 29:14.252
You won't listen to us anyway,

29:15.378 --> 29:16.504
so just beat me up.

29:17.338 --> 29:19.090
You can do it too.

29:22.510 --> 29:23.720
Fucking lunatic.

29:24.888 --> 29:26.973
Hey, drop the fucking act, asshole.

29:29.642 --> 29:31.644
I heard you killed a guy
at your old school.

29:32.729 --> 29:33.646
Am I wrong?

29:36.399 --> 29:37.442
Right.

29:38.359 --> 29:41.112
You didn't kill him. You just crippled him

29:41.988 --> 29:42.947
to a vegetative state.

29:46.159 --> 29:47.619
Fuck, man.

29:48.661 --> 29:51.664
You ruined someone's life.
Don't pretend you're a nice guy.

29:55.418 --> 29:57.128
You fucking hypocrite.

30:17.565 --> 30:18.983
Son of a bitch! Damn it!

30:47.136 --> 30:50.807
Son of a bitch. Goddamn it!

31:01.568 --> 31:02.610
Fuck!

31:04.028 --> 31:05.530
Sneaky little asshole.

31:06.823 --> 31:07.949
You bastard.

31:12.871 --> 31:14.330
Gentlemen!

31:16.165 --> 31:17.709
A while it's been since…

31:19.002 --> 31:20.920
It's been a while, you bastards.

31:22.589 --> 31:24.048
Were you two having fun?

31:25.508 --> 31:26.718
Motherfuckers.

31:30.054 --> 31:31.347
Mess them up!

31:44.444 --> 31:45.403
Fucking asshole!

31:47.113 --> 31:49.908
You fucker. What?
Are you going to stab me with that?

32:10.637 --> 32:13.056
- Kick him! Bitch! Fucking asshole!
- Fuck!

32:15.016 --> 32:18.102
Fucking asshole! Son of a bitch! Fucker!

32:18.186 --> 32:19.938
Fucker!

32:23.983 --> 32:25.026
Fuck, man.

32:26.736 --> 32:29.113
You ain't shit, okay?

32:34.285 --> 32:35.745
Everyone, freeze!

32:48.257 --> 32:50.385
- Who is that punk?
- What the fuck?

32:50.468 --> 32:52.595
- Isn't that Baku?
- That's Baku?

32:53.346 --> 32:55.640
THE WAY TO YOU (SLAM DUNK OPENING)

33:25.837 --> 33:26.754
Hey, Gotak.

33:28.381 --> 33:29.757
Don't I look like Sakuragi?

33:32.802 --> 33:34.095
Bullshit. Hey.

33:34.929 --> 33:36.723
Is that hot sauce in your hair?

33:42.478 --> 33:43.312
Hyo-mans!

33:44.188 --> 33:46.149
What do you think, pal?

33:46.691 --> 33:47.942
I'm like Sakuragi, right?

33:48.443 --> 33:51.446
Well, I haven't read that manga yet.

33:52.488 --> 33:55.450
Hey, anyway, about this situation?

33:56.034 --> 33:58.745
It's definitely easy to misunderstand it.

34:01.414 --> 34:02.707
Why?

34:18.473 --> 34:19.682
Projectile motion?

34:20.641 --> 34:24.437
Horizontal distance is proportional
to the square of the velocity.

34:56.969 --> 34:57.929
And who are you?

34:59.055 --> 35:00.431
I've never seen you before.

35:02.809 --> 35:04.310
You've got a lot of guts.

38:14.834 --> 38:18.254
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
